    "scope": {
      "zh": "本页仅收录官方2027款AION i60配置表第4列「700 激光雷达版」（纯电）。国内指导价仅用于核对版本，不是出口报价或可供现货承诺。所有展示参数和装备均按该列及原表合并单元格核对，不混用旧650版本、520版本或1738增程版；未列明的零百加速、最高车速、变速箱、整备质量及方向盘位置留空。标准轮胎为215/55 R18，225/45 R19为选装；19寸轮毂、11扬声器音响、车外投影仪及车顶行李架均按官方表标为选装，不把经销商促销赠送当作永久标配。700km为CLTC测试续航，22分钟为30%至80%快充测试时间，非实际使用保证。中国市场辅助驾驶、车机互联和联网服务在出口目的地的可用性须单独核实，辅助驾驶不能替代驾驶员；国内保修条件不自动适用于出口。",
      "en": "Only column 4, the battery-electric 700 LiDAR trim, of the official MY2027 AION i60 table is listed. The domestic guide price is used only to verify trim identity, not as an export quotation or confirmation of stock. All displayed specifications and equipment are checked against this column with the original merged-cell spans expanded. No specifications are inherited from the older 650, 520 or 1738 range-extended versions. Unlisted 0–100 km/h acceleration, top speed, transmission, curb weight and steering-wheel position remain blank. Standard tyres are 215/55 R18; 225/45 R19 tyres are optional. The 19-inch wheels, 11-speaker audio, external projector and roof rails are optional in the official table; dealer promotional gifts are not treated as permanent standard equipment. The 700 km figure is CLTC test range and 22 minutes is the tested 30–80% DC charging time, not real-world guarantees. Export-market availability of China-market driver assistance, phone connectivity and connected services requires separate verification. Driver assistance does not replace the driver, and domestic warranty terms do not automatically apply overseas."
    },
